  <item nodeId="node-11">
    <command xml:space="preserve">u</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">High Above the Royal Aerie&#x000A;Your summoned mist both obscures you and blocks you from seeing the Royal Aerie.  But you've already memorized its layout,and how it relates to today's air currents, winds, and thermals.  Royal Quarters to the north and down, well defended by circling Raven clan guards.  The Librum to the east and down.  In the center of the Aerie (and directly below you) is the Great Hall.  Other royal aeries dot the forest in the distance, but this complex holds your quarry.&#x000A;&#x000A;The black capsa follows you from Royal Gardens, spiraling towards the gold capsa of down.&#x000A;&#x000A;You dodge and weave and almost get away from your pursuers, but when "down" always points straight at you, even when they can't see you, they always know where you are.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve">High Above the Royal Aerie&#x000A;Your summoned mist both obscures you and blocks you from seeing the Royal Aerie.  But you've already memorized its layout,and how it relates to today's air currents, winds, and thermals.  Royal Quarters to the north and down, well defended by circling Raven clan guards.  The Librum to the east and down.  In the center of the Aerie (and directly below you) is the Great Hall.  Other royal aeries dot the forest in the distance, but this complex holds your quarry.&#x000A;&#x000A;The black capsa follows you from Royal Gardens, spiraling towards the gold capsa of down.&#x000A;&#x000A;You dodge and weave and almost get away from your pursuers, but when "down" always points straight at you, even when they can't see you, they always know where you are.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-12"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-12">
    <command xml:space="preserve">u</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You take to the skies even higher.&#x000A;&#x000A;The black capsa spins past you as you dodge away from the Raven Guard, and turns in a lazy arc to follow you again.&#x000A;&#x000A;The guards charge, but you manage to evade their uncoordinated attack.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve">You take to the skies even higher.&#x000A;&#x000A;The black capsa spins past you as you dodge away from the Raven Guard, and turns in a lazy arc to follow you again.&#x000A;&#x000A;The guards charge, but you manage to evade their uncoordinated attack.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-13"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-13">
    <command xml:space="preserve">u</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You take to the skies even higher.&#x000A;&#x000A;The black capsa finally spirals towards the gold capsa and falls into the rucksack!&#x000A;&#x000A;You dodge and weave and almost get away from your pursuers, but when "down" always points straight at you, even when they can't see you, they always know where you are.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve">You take to the skies even higher.&#x000A;&#x000A;The black capsa finally spirals towards the gold capsa and falls into the rucksack!&#x000A;&#x000A;You dodge and weave and almost get away from your pursuers, but when "down" always points straight at you, even when they can't see you, they always know where you are.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-14"/>
    </children>
  </item>
