  <item nodeId="node-67">
    <command xml:space="preserve">1</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">[Is that real?]&#x000A;&#x000A;Horatio shrugs.  "I cannot prove it is so.  Many have chosen not to believe.  But I can sense capsae, so I sought this one out, and found it in the ruins of Creshim."&#x000A;&#x000A;1) Wow.&#x000A;2) OK, I'm a tester and I need to skip ahead and be Constance, fiddling with scrolls and stuff.&#x000A;3) I'm also a tester, and I just want to go back to the beginning of this conversation.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
