  <item nodeId="node-117">
    <command xml:space="preserve">undo</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">High Above the Royal Aerie&#x000A;[Previous turn undone.]&#x000A;&#x000A;"You've seen the scrolls themselves?  The writing on them?"&#x000A;&#x000A;"'Indeed,'" Constance replies, raising an eyebrow.  You grin.&#x000A;&#x000A;"What you may not know is that those symbols are not found in any other form of known writing.  There are fragments of writing from before the capsae.  They differ.  Some say it is the language of the gods themselves."&#x000A;&#x000A;"Woo, fancy," says Constance.  "In other words, they're gibberish."&#x000A;&#x000A;"No," you reply.  "I can read them."&#x000A;&#x000A;"Oh?  What do they say?" Constance asks.&#x000A;&#x000A;1) Tell her the truth.&#x000A;2) Wax poetical a bit.&#x000A;3) OK, I'm a tester and I need to skip ahead and be Constance, fiddling with scrolls and stuff.&#x000A;4) I'm also a tester, and I just want to go back to the beginning of this conversation.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
