  <item nodeId="node-140">
    <command xml:space="preserve">1</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">[Pull everything together.]&#x000A;&#x000A;"So that's your heresy," you conclude.  "You want to read a capsa's scroll.  And change the world again."&#x000A;&#x000A;"Not just any capsa.  The scroll of health.  Taclor.  Ten years ago, I would have been happy to read any.  Now, it must be that one.  But I will not make that choice on my own.  Every Reader like myself has the innate ability to Read a single scroll, and I will yield to the will of its holder, as my predecessors swore to do in the aftermath of the Great War.  But I will not waste my ability on anything else."&#x000A;&#x000A;1) But you need the scroll for your mother!&#x000A;2) You need more details.&#x000A;3) OK, I'm a tester and I need to skip ahead and be Constance, fiddling with scrolls and stuff.&#x000A;4) I'm also a tester, and I just want to go back to the beginning of this conversation.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
