  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-163">
    <command xml:space="preserve">e</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You fly through the door, and immediately regret your decision.  In an instant, the Raven Guard has followed you, and you simply don't have any room to maneuver.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You have been captured. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT, or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve">You fly through the door, and immediately regret your decision.  In an instant, the Raven Guard has followed you, and you simply don't have any room to maneuver.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You have been captured. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT, or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</commentary>
