  <item nodeId="node-172">
    <command xml:space="preserve">in</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Using the extra speed from your dive, you quietly plunge through the Librum door behind the distracted guard, pulling up sharply on the other side before crashing into anything.&#x000A;&#x000A;(first opening the Librum Door)&#x000A;The guard is entirely too watchful to let you do that, even going as fast as you are.&#x000A;&#x000A;The momentum you had from your dive wears off.  Fun while it lasted!&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve">Using the extra speed from your dive, you quietly plunge through the Librum door behind the distracted guard, pulling up sharply on the other side before crashing into anything.&#x000A;&#x000A;(first opening the Librum Door)&#x000A;The guard is entirely too watchful to let you do that, even going as fast as you are.&#x000A;&#x000A;The momentum you had from your dive wears off.  Fun while it lasted!&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</commentary>
