  <item nodeId="node-184">
    <command xml:space="preserve">undo</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Librum&#x000A;[Previous turn undone.]&#x000A;&#x000A;The Librum contains two levels of scrolls and books, with easy access to all of the curving shelves, and plenty of reading roosts with natural and artificial lighting.  You know from your childhood where the best roosts are, and what sections contain the most exciting stories.  In the center of the lower room is a lavish display case, now hastily boarded over, which three days ago held the purple, gold, and red capsae.  The Librum Door is back up at the top level.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve">Librum&#x000A;[Previous turn undone.]&#x000A;&#x000A;The Librum contains two levels of scrolls and books, with easy access to all of the curving shelves, and plenty of reading roosts with natural and artificial lighting.  You know from your childhood where the best roosts are, and what sections contain the most exciting stories.  In the center of the lower room is a lavish display case, now hastily boarded over, which three days ago held the purple, gold, and red capsae.  The Librum Door is back up at the top level.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-185"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-185">
    <command xml:space="preserve">achievements</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You have gained the following achievements:&#x000A;* Hunting Stoop: Escape the Raven Guard with a very long dive.&#x000A;* Mist Me!: Escape the Raven Guard into your summoned fog.&#x000A;* Go, Go, Go!: Escape the Raven Guard by diving while "haste" is active.&#x000A;&#x000A;Use ACHIEVEMENTS ON/OFF to turn on or off achievement notifications, or ACHIEVEMENTS FULL to list both gained and ungained achievements.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve">You have gained the following achievements:&#x000A;* Hunting Stoop: Escape the Raven Guard with a very long dive.&#x000A;* Mist Me!: Escape the Raven Guard into your summoned fog.&#x000A;* Go, Go, Go!: Escape the Raven Guard by diving while "haste" is active.&#x000A;&#x000A;Use ACHIEVEMENTS ON/OFF to turn on or off achievement notifications, or ACHIEVEMENTS FULL to list both gained and ungained achievements.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</commentary>
