    <command xml:space="preserve">x cloak</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">In prehistoric times, people apparently made these cloaks out of hippotomai skins to mask their scent.  The dark purple variegation also helped with camoflage.  You couldn't fly with them on, but some prey had gotten extremely adept and spotting flying enemies, so hunters took to sneaking up on foot.  On foot!&#x000A;.&#x000A;&gt;</result>
