  <item nodeId="node-282">
    <command xml:space="preserve">2</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">[Leave with the capsa, and leave Ash behind.]&#x000A;&#x000A;This is what you came here to do.  You have the capsa of health.  Your mother; your village needs it.  You could leave.&#x000A;&#x000A;If it hadn't been Ash who would suffer, you probably could do it.  Random people working for the queen versus your own mother?  Your own people?&#x000A;&#x000A;But not Ash.  You have to find another way.&#x000A;&#x000A;Horatio looks at you expectantly.&#x000A;&#x000A;1) Leave without the capsa.&#x000A;2) Leave with the capsa, and take Ash with you.&#x000A;3) Let Horatio read the scroll of taclor.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve">[Leave with the capsa, and leave Ash behind.]&#x000A;&#x000A;This is what you came here to do.  You have the capsa of health.  Your mother; your village needs it.  You could leave.&#x000A;&#x000A;If it hadn't been Ash who would suffer, you probably could do it.  Random people working for the queen versus your own mother?  Your own people?&#x000A;&#x000A;But not Ash.  You have to find another way.&#x000A;&#x000A;Horatio looks at you expectantly.&#x000A;&#x000A;1) Leave without the capsa.&#x000A;2) Leave with the capsa, and take Ash with you.&#x000A;3) Let Horatio read the scroll of taclor.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</commentary>
