  <item nodeId="node-287">
    <command xml:space="preserve">1</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">[Try to explain.]&#x000A;&#x000A;You had hoped to have a day or two first.  To explain after the shock wore off.  That plan is not to be, and you can barely breathe.  "Constance-" you choke, "her mother.  Couldn't sacrifice Ash.  Tried to-"&#x000A;&#x000A;The queen cuts you off.  "WHERE?" she demands.&#x000A;&#x000A;1) Refuse to speak.&#x000A;2) Offer to lead her to them.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve">[Try to explain.]&#x000A;&#x000A;You had hoped to have a day or two first.  To explain after the shock wore off.  That plan is not to be, and you can barely breathe.  "Constance-" you choke, "her mother.  Couldn't sacrifice Ash.  Tried to-"&#x000A;&#x000A;The queen cuts you off.  "WHERE?" she demands.&#x000A;&#x000A;1) Refuse to speak.&#x000A;2) Offer to lead her to them.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</commentary>
