  <item nodeId="node-298">
    <command xml:space="preserve">achievements</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You have gained the following achievements:&#x000A;* Taclor: Finish the game, deciding what to do with the scroll of health.&#x000A;* The Old Cruising Grounds: Make it back inside the Royal Quarters.&#x000A;* One Bird's Trash: Obtain the black capsa of igram.&#x000A;* Bar None: Get the barred and locked doors of the Great Hall open.&#x000A;* Hunting Stoop: Escape the Raven Guard with a very long dive.&#x000A;&#x000A;Use ACHIEVEMENTS ON/OFF to turn on or off achievement notifications, or ACHIEVEMENTS FULL to list both gained and ungained achievements.&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT, UNDO the last command, or get a list of the ACHIEVEMENTS you obtained?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
